    "our_story_founders": {
      "type": "our-story-founders",
      "settings": {
        "background_color": "#ffffff",
        "eyebrow": "Our Founders",
        "heading": "Rooted in Family. Built on Passion.",
        "body": "<p>Open Container Wine was created with a simple but powerful belief — that great wine should be accessible to everyone. Inspired by Grandma Rosa's unwavering work ethic and love for hospitality, our family set out to create a place where people can enjoy exceptional wines, learn, celebrate, and make memories.</p>",
        "button_label": "Learn More About Us",
        "button_url": "",
        "button_new_tab": false,
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/Gemini_Generated_Image_dq3b5pdq3b5pdq3b.png",
        "padding_top": 80,
        "padding_bottom": 80
      }
    },
    "our_story_legacy": {
      "type": "our-story-legacy",
      "settings": {
        "background_color": "#1a1a1a",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/Gemini_Generated_Image_jo2nb6jo2nb6jo2n.png",
        "caption_number": "56",
        "caption": "Tradition isn't something we inherit, it's something we preserve.",
        "eyebrow": "The Heart Of Our Story",
        "heading": "The Woman Behind Our Legacy",
        "body": "<p>Our story begins with Grandma Rosa, whose passion, resilience, and dedication became the heart of Open Container Wine. She taught us that wine is more than a drink — it's a way to bring people together and create lasting memories.</p>",
        "quote": "Wine brings people together. We create experiences that connect friends and family.",
        "quote_author": "Grandma Rosa",
        "quote_title": "Our Inspiration, Our Foundation",
        "padding_top": 80,
        "padding_bottom": 80
      }
    },
